# 白名单策略：先忽略全部，再逐项放行

/*

!/requirement-decomposition/
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/LICENSE
!/.gitignore

# 技能包内部的噪声

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.directory

.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# 跑自举冒烟的中间文件，不是源码
*.log
*.tmp
skeleton.json
interview-state.json
transcript.json
需求文档/
validation-report.txt
validation-report.json
impact-report.md
